G3992.definition:
πέμπω  
 [in LXX chiefly for שָׁלַח ;] 
 to send ; 
 __(a)  of persons : with accusative, absol.,  Mat.22:7 ,  Luk.7:19 ,  Jhn.1:22 ,  2Co.9:3 , al.; ptcp. before verb.,  Mat.14:10 ,  Act.19:31 , al.; ptcp. before διά (=  Heb.  יָד;,  1Ki.16:20 , al.),  Mat.11:2  (cf.  Rev.1:1 ); of teachers sent by God,  Jhn.1:33 4:34 ,  Rom.8:3 , al.; with accusative and dative,  1Co.4:17 ,  Php.2:19 ; before πρός, with accusative,  Luk.4:26 ,  Jhn.16:7 , al.; before λέγων (cf.  Heb.  אָמַר שָׁלַח  Gen.38:25 , al.),  Luk.7:6, 19 ; before εἰς, with accusative loc.,  Mat.2:8 ,  Luk.15:15 , al.; before εἰς (of purpose),  Eph.6:22 ,  Col.4:8 ,  1Pe.2:14 ; with inf.,  Jhn.1:33 ,  1Co.16:3 ,  Rev.22:16 ; 
 __(b)  of things  :  Rev.11:10;  before εἰς,  Rev.1:11;  id., of purpose,  Act.11:29 ,  Php.4:16 ; with dative of person(s),  2Th.2:11;  π. τ. δρέπανον σου (cf. εξαποστείλατε δρέπανα = מַגָּל שָׁלַח,  Jol.3:13 ),  Rev.14:15, 18  (cf. ἀνα-, ἐκ-, μετα-, προ-, συν-πέμπω) 
   SYN. : ἀποστέλλω, q.v   (AS)

G3996.definition:
πενθέω , -ῶ 
 [in LXX chiefly for אָבַל ;] 
to mourn (for), lament; 
 __(a) intrans. :  Mat.5:4  (5)  Mat.9:15 ,  1Co.5:2 ; π. καὶ κλαίειν,  Mat.16:10 ,  Luk.6:25 ,  Jas.4:9 ,  Rev.18:15, 19 ; before ἐπί, with accusative,  Rev.18:11;  
 __(b) trans., with accusative,  2Co.12:21. †
   SYN. : see: θρηνέω   (AS)
